UFO 50 for Anbernic RG35XX (original, non-H700) running MiaUI v2.0.0 is a
port of https://github.com/Producdevity/ufo50-miyoo-mini-port (v0.1.9).

This port cross-compiles that project's vendored Butterscotch runtime for the
RG35XX's armhf/glibc userland (MiaUI SYSTEM is glibc 2.37, Buildroot 2023.05.1,
INTERP /lib/ld-linux-armhf.so.3) and adds the MiaUI-specific gamepad mapping,
joystick-name performance fix, clean-exit hotkey, launcher and packaging.

Upstream runtime: the Butterscotch GameMaker runner, AGPL-3.0 (see LICENSE).
Onion branch base:
  https://github.com/cobaltgit/Butterscotch/tree/onion-v2
  commit 92ed6b8c3766361a201a69d202bcde5873cdad7e
Maintained upstream at:
  https://github.com/ButterscotchRunner/Butterscotch
Original Miyoo Mini port and UFO50 compatibility work:
  https://github.com/Producdevity/ufo50-miyoo-mini-port

Third-party dependency notices are in licenses/THIRD_PARTY.txt. SDL 1.2.15 and
alsa-lib are cross-compiled at build time; the built libasound is NOT shipped
(bundling it shadows MiaUI's system libasound and breaks audio).

MiaUI is by DSkywalk: https://github.com/miaui-cfw/MiaUI-GPU-RG35XX

UFO 50 is made by Mossmouth and its creators. No game files (data.win, audio
groups, textures, fonts) are included - you must supply your own Windows copy.
